  "description": "Aipas C1 Max Xpress ST Urban Commuter E-Bike\nThe Aipas C1 Max Xpress ST is built for riders who demand more power, longer range, and all-day comfort in a city-ready design. Whether you're commuting to work, cruising through downtown streets, or handling daily errands, this e-bike delivers smooth acceleration, extended mileage, and a confident ride on any urban terrain.\n\nEngineered for responsive power and smooth throttle control, perfect for city hills, bridges, and stop-and-go traffic.\n\nGo farther with fewer charges—ideal for long commutes and weekend rides.\n\n3. Smooth & Stable Ride\n\nEnjoy a balanced ride with improved grip, stability, and shock absorption—even on rough or uneven roads.\n\n4. Safety & Visibility\n\nIntegrated brake light and tail light for enhanced visibility\n\nBuilt to keep you safe and seen, day or night.\n\nAdapt effortlessly to traffic, inclines, and open roads with smooth shifting and reliable performance.\n\nDesigned to reduce fatigue and maximize comfort on longer rides.\n\n7. Built for Urban Living\nFrom daily commuting to quick errands and weekend cruising, the C1 Max Xpress ST strikes the perfect balance between power, comfort, and practicality.\n\nCustomize your ride based on your needs—efficiency, speed, or effortless cruising.\n\nPremium paint finish infused with metallic flakes delivers a vibrant, eye-catching look under sunlight.\n\n10. Easy Assembly\n\n90% pre-assembled (front wheel installed)\nQuick and beginner-friendly setup\n\nStart riding in minutes with minimal effort.\n\nSummary\nThe Aipas C1 Max Xpress ST combines power, range, and comfort into one versatile urban commuter. With an 1100W peak motor, 90 Nm torque, and up to 85 miles of range, it’s built to handle the demands of modern city riding with ease.\nLightweight yet durable, comfortable yet powerful—this is the e-bike designed to keep up with your everyday life.\nPair it with essential accessories like a phone mount or bike lock for a smarter, safer, and more convenient ride.",
